= A Supreme Court Vacancy

Justice Scalia's death has left a vacancy on the Supreme Court in an election year.

[? if dem_president = 1 and dem_senate = 1 : A Democratic Senate stands ready to confirm a moderate nominee. ?][? if dem_president = 1 and dem_senate = 0 : The Republican Senate has signaled it will not hold hearings on any Democratic nominee. ?][? if dem_president = 0 : The Republican president will fill the seat quickly. ?]

- @scalia_nominee: Press the nomination fight
- @scalia_compromise: Seek a compromise

@scalia_nominee
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.dem_president && Q.dem_senate) { Q.court_lean -= 1; }
if (Q.dem_president && !Q.dem_senate) { Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 0.8); Q.polarization += 1; }
if (!Q.dem_president) { Q.court_lean += 1; Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 0.4); }
!}

We use every procedural tool and every public platform to make the Court a campaign issue.

@scalia_compromise
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.dem_president && Q.dem_senate) { Q.court_lean -= 0.5; }
if (Q.dem_president && !Q.dem_senate) { Q.court_lean += 0.3; }
if (!Q.dem_president) { Q.court_lean += 0.8; }
Q.gopmod_relation += 4; Q.progressive_dissent += 3; Q.institutions += 1;
!}

We appeal for a consensus nominee to protect the Court's legitimacy.
